# 

#
# Tags files within chezmoi target path with an xattr, if the platform and
# destination filesystem support it, with value corresponding to chezmoi
# management. Logs skips and failures to a dedicated log.
#
# Fails on paths containing newline characters.
#

# https://github.com/chewygumxx/chezmoi-apply-xattr

